      "method": "actual_pixels_view_image",
      "observations": "The diagram converts X_d and its derivatives to theta_d and its derivatives before joint-error/gain processing and torque to the arm. Its one summing icon compresses mixed-unit channels; a literal unweighted sum of position, velocity and acceleration is not a valid physical error equation. The returned actual signal is theta. The prose defines X as position-only [x y z]^T."
    },
    {
