      "method": "actual_pixels_view_image",
      "observations": "The diagram clearly returns measured theta through Kin(theta) to actual X at the negative comparator input. Desired X_d enters positively and coordinate conversion/gains produce torque. This is Cartesian error feedback, not a direct Cartesian force actuator or removal of kinematics."
    },
    {
