      "observations": "The slide lists natural workspace specification and easier end-effector/straight-path control, alongside conversion, Jacobian and inverse-transformation cost inside the loop. These are potential design benefits and implementation costs, not universal exact tracking or a claim every Cartesian method requires an inverse."
    },
