      "observations": "Actual diagram order is Cartesian error, J inverse, joint displacement correction, gains, torque, arm, measured theta through forward kinematics. Matrix multiplication order is K_q J^-1. The displacement relation is a local differential mapping, not exact finite IK; singular configurations invalidate an ordinary inverse."
    },
    {
