      "method": "actual_pixels_view_image",
      "observations": "Actual diagram order is Cartesian error, gains producing virtual force F, Jacobian transpose producing torque, arm, and forward-kinematics feedback. Gain units differ from the previous joint-displacement controller. Transpose exists for rectangular or singular Jacobians but does not guarantee every task direction is controllable."
    },
    {
